The code in this package is released under the MIT License, as is the course
repository it lives in.

The datasets keep the licenses of their original sources, which differ. Each
dataset's help page names its source and license. In brief:

  CC0 / public domain   fl_bbs, reef_fish_*, deer_movement, the
                        European amphibian traits file in extdata, and the
                        class examples built from them
  CC-BY 4.0             avonet, amniotes, coral_cover, tosca_rov, and the
                        beetle_* tables (credit Brian Maitner)
  CC-BY 3.0             tara
  CC-BY-NC 4.0          mangroves: not for commercial use
  See its help page     code_sharing, compiled by Brian Maitner

Please cite the original source of any dataset you use.
